  "stageId": "main_04-04",
  "title": "不要恐慌",
  "storyCode": "4-4",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "7f82a5ee2eacc0cfe36055a15282909f4afd8299fa7ba64a9aaabef66b2b78e4",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三十二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "哈，哈......可惡......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "總算......解決了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "......不，還沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "那些空中飄蕩下來的粉塵......是怎麼回事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "text": "咕，咕......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "text": "呃，呃啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "text": "好疼......好疼啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "text": "啊啊......啊啊！好癢，好癢！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "text": "啊啊？！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "text": "羅......羅德島！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "text": "敵人......敵人！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "什......！怎麼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "剛才被打倒的整合運動又站起來了——？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "怎麼？不行了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "光芒，從那個傢伙的法杖裡......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "我可還沒有動手哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "而且......還有更多敵人增援.....",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "可惡......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "現在，只能依賴這一發弩彈能把敵人的首領......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "不。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "哈哈......這種情況下，你們還有討論的餘裕嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "真自信啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "呵，就讓這發弩彈教教你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "不，隕星。不行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "嘖......！為什麼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "快撤退。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "我感受到了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "是他們。他們來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "嗯？不射擊嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "真可惜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "之後，你們就沒機會了哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "他要撤退了？可是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "隕星！射擊西側那棟危樓，快！至少可以分散敵人的注意力！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "......只能這樣了！沒問題！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "潔西卡，跑起來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "誒？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "......雪怪們來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "等......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "text": "好、好冷......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "................走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "立刻。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "......潔西卡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "她說得對。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "我們快走......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "阿米婭，聽得見嗎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "喂，喂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "text": "快走！我掩護你們！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "聽好，阿米婭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "——不要來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "text": "這個廢城分城是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
